  "description": "The XP™ Step-Thru 2.0 breaks down every barrier to adventure, combining all the award-winning benefits of our flagship XP™ 2.0 with ultimate accessibility. A proprietary XP-Entry™ frame allows bikers to step into their ride with a simple, lateral motion—engineered to accommodate all mobility levels. Uniquely equipped with both variable pedal assist and throttle, the XP™ Step-Thru 2.0 also delivers the speed and sustainability to own the road as either a Class1, 2, or 3 ebike. Fat tires, coupled with adjustable front fork suspension, are designed to power through all types of terrain, while a foldable design guarantees your ride will fit into virtually any compact space. The XP™ Step-Thru 2.0 is the epitome of our brand, offering exclusive features to inspire the most inclusive experience.",
